include ../mixins/evidence.pug

h3(wiki="https://phasmophobia.fandom.com/wiki/Kormos") Kormos
    img(src="ghost-icons/kormos.png")
ul
    li Sanity Hunt Threshold increases to 70% if a player sprints in the same room as the ghost.
    li When Hunting, it is entirely blind and cannot detect players visually, but hears footsteps.
    ul
        li If it hears players' footsteps on the same floor (Sprint: 30m, Walk: 15m, Crouch: 10m), it travels to the sound.
        li Hunting Speed is 30% faster when traveling to a sound more than 5m away.
        li If it detects player movement within 5m, Hunting Speed accelerates by up to 65%.
    li When Hunting, it kills within 1.5m, ignoring walls and physical obstacles.
    li Ghost Events will never be ghost mist or chasing type.
ul.evidence
    +box
    +orb
    +ultraviolet
    +earlyhunt
    +fast